This game is fun, except that it crashes ____ A ____ LOT____.
If you want a game that has:
- random memory dumps causing it to crash;
- network disconnections, even though network connectivity for all other programs is fine;
- no game re-join capability if you do get disconnected (which you will);
- unstable hosting for online co-op that crashes every 2-3 games;
It's especially fun when you play for 45 minutes, building your characters in a co-op game, then crash.
If these issues can be fixed, I would have no hesitation recommending the game to other people. As it is now, its... "good enough" for $2 I guess.

